#: ../../source/docs/common-botwingf405.rst:7 5313a29048764221b6393fdb9df69ba3
msgid "BOTWINGF405"
msgstr "BOTWINGF405"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botwingf405.rst:9 97a398e196b1490d930a75d085b91b7d
msgid ""
"The BOTWINGF405 is a compact, high-performance flight controller developed "
"for fixed-wing and FPV applications. Designed for reliability and "
"flexibility, it integrates essential sensors and features for smooth flight "
"and rich telemetry, produced by `BOTLAB DYNAMICS "
"<https://www.botlabdynamics.store/>`_."
msgstr ""
"BOTWINGF405 是由 `BOTLAB DYNAMICS <https://www.botlabdynamics.store/>`_ "
"生产的一款紧凑型高性能飞控，专为固定翼和FPV应用设计，集成了必要的传感器和功能，实现流畅飞行和丰富数传。"

