#: ../../source/docs/common-botwingf405.rst:88
#: 2bd96dfe0db043409743b30438d4d217
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botwingf405.rst:89
#: 12815daf4a3a4e498dbd7356c23122cf
msgid ""
"The RX1 input by default is mapped to a timer input instead of UART`1, and "
"can be used for all ArduPilot supported unidirectional receiver protocols. "
"The SBUS pads are inverted and tied to this input and should not be "
"connected to anything if the RX1 is used. Bi-directional procols such as "
"CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which require a true UART connection to both R1 and TX1 "
"(see below). FPort with tlemetery also requires a full UART AND an external "
"bi-directional inverter."
msgstr ""
"RX1输入默认映射至定时器输入而非UART1，支持ArduPilot所有单向接收机协议。SBUS焊盘经反相后连接至此输入，若使用RX1则不应在SBUS焊盘上连接任何设备。双向协议如CRSF/ELRS和SRXL2需要通过完整UART同时连接R1和TX1（见下文）。带数传的FPort还需要完整UART和外部双向反相器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botwingf405.rst:91
#: 48d800f3228645058fa89859572eb02e
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, the RX1 pin must be configured to be used as true UART RX pin for"
" use with bi-directional systems by setting the "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` to “1” so it becomes the SERIAL1 "
"port’s RX input pin.ref:\\ ``SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>`` is "
"alreaddy set by deault to “23” to allow RC reciever connection to UART1."
msgstr ""
"要启用CRSF以及FPort、CRSF、SRXL2接收机内嵌的数传，必须将RX1引脚配置为真正的UART RX引脚，以用于双向系统：将 "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` 设置为 「1」，使其成为SERIAL1端口的RX输入引脚。ref:\\ "
"``SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>`` 默认已设置为 「23」，以允许接收机通过UART1连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botwingf405.rst:93
#: 4483f045f02541d0869a169d9f588530
msgid ""
"With this option: * PPM is not supported. * FPort requires connection to TX1"
" via an external bi-directional and :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` "
"be set to “7”. * CRSF also requires a TX1 connection, in addition to R6, and"
" automatically provides telemetry. Set "
":ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` to “0”. * SRXL2 requires a "
"connection to T1 and automatically provides telemetry. Set "
":ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` to “4”."
msgstr ""
"启用此选项后：* 不支持PPM。* FPort需通过外部双向反相器连接TX1，并将 "
":ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「7」。* "
"CRSF除需连接R6外，还需连接TX1，并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 设置为 "
"「0」。* SRXL2需连接T1，并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botwingf405.rst:99
#: a58a1b2ad7e24e1d9a39116d6c9f484f
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"more details."
msgstr ""
"在ArduPilot中，任意UART均可用于RC系统连接，兼容除PPM以外的所有协议。详情请参阅 :ref:`common-rc-systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botwingf405.rst:102
#: a55f6083c8e44cfbac084ac0d997b165
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botwingf405.rst:103
#: dcc6cc8a9f4d4a1796a3361fc44e9f70
msgid ""
"The BOTWINGF405 includes an internal AT7456E OSD enabled for analog video. "
"Simultaneous DisplayPort operation is enabled by default on UART3"
msgstr "BOTWINGF405 内置AT7456E OSD，已为模拟视频启用。同时在UART3上默认启用DisplayPort显示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botwingf405.rst:106
#: ff6e4a8a00c24df08faee4cb05a764a6
msgid "PWM Outputs"
msgstr "PWM输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botwingf405.rst:107
#: deb45742a5fa4ef180af23be43243668
msgid ""
"All motor/servo outputs are Dshot and PWM capable. M1-4 are also BDshot "
"capable. However, mixing Dshot, serial LED, and normal PWM operation for "
"outputs is restricted into groups, ie. enabling Dshot for an output in a "
"group requires that ALL outputs in that group be configured and used as "
"Dshot, rather than PWM outputs."
msgstr ""
"所有电机/舵机输出均支持DShot和PWM。M1-4还支持双向DShot（BDshot）。但DShot、串行LED和普通PWM输出的混用受组限制：若某组中某输出启用了DShot，则该组所有输出都必须配置并使用DShot，而非PWM输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botwingf405.rst:109
#: 0fae7a3cbfd142dcb17c5c69f057aecf
msgid "PWM 1,2 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1、2 在第1组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-botwingf405.rst:111
